title: snes-obc1-python
message: >-
  If you use this work, or the states it was settled against, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Gustavo
    family-names: Franco
    alias: gufranco
repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/snes-obc1-python
url: https://github.com/gufranco/snes-obc1-python
abstract: >-
  A model of the OBC1, the small address translator in Metal Combat that rewrites
  sprite attribute writes into the layout the console expects. Every address in
  its window is settled exhaustively against a reference implementation, in both
  of the two banks the control register selects.
keywords:
  - emulation
  - super-nintendo
  - obc1
  - sprites
  - hardware-model
  - conformance
